const branchGeometry=new T.BufferGeometry(),boughPoints=[],boughUV=[],boughIndex=[];for(let j=0;j<=4;j++)for(let i=0;i<=8;i++){const u=i/8,v=j/4;boughPoints.push(u,Math.sin(u*Math.PI)*.065-u*.16,(v-.5)*.8);boughUV.push(u,v);if(i&&j){const a=j*9+i;boughIndex.push(a-10,a-1,a-9,a-9,a-1,a);}}branchGeometry.setAttribute('position',new T.Float32BufferAttribute(boughPoints,3));branchGeometry.setAttribute('uv',new T.Float32BufferAttribute(boughUV,2));branchGeometry.setIndex(boughIndex);branchGeometry.computeVertexNormals();const branchMatrices=[],larchMatrices=[],trunkMatrices=[],dummy=new T.Object3D(),trunkGeo=new T.CylinderGeometry(.022,.19,4.5,11,5);
